Package: SpaxNMF
Type: Package
Title: Regularized Non-negative Matrix Factorization for IFU Cubes
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(
      "Rafael", "S. de Souza",
      email = "r.s.desouza@herts.ac.uk",
      role = c("aut", "cre"),
      comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7207-4584")
    )
Description: SpaxNMF provides tools for reshaping integral field spectroscopy
    (IFU) cubes, fitting regularized non-negative matrix factorization
    models, and inspecting recovered component spectra and spatial weights.
    The package supports reproducible IFU demonstrations, controlled toy
    benchmarks, and matched comparisons between PCA, vanilla NMF, and
    spatially regularized NMF on real and synthetic data.
